  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Add the ability to define a new folder/location for the downloaded cache in-game.\nThere is already a way to change the cache location; but it requires creating an arbitrary config file with only a single entry in an arbitrarily specific location.\nThis is unnecessary inaccessible, sure experienced tech users understand its a thing; but beginners or people who's gaming experience is on consoles have little to no idea what they are doing, leaving them susceptible to scams and viruses.\nCountless guides and google searches can be avoided with a single option in a menu.\nFor some users changing the cache location is a necessity, to make the game function properly for any period of time.",
